      "writtenOn": "2019-05-09T02:15:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The difference is if pd_get_saved_port_flags fails, we immediately return or we set explicit_contract_in_place to zero and return at 2365, right?\n\nIf we immediately return, there is no need to read the code below to learn we do nothing but return.",
